{"id":"be68cce492414c6b","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-solovay-theorem.md","title":"Solovay's Theorem","display":"thm-solovay-theorem — Solovay's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-solovay-theorem","aliases":["89-thm-solovay-theorem"],"display":"thm-solovay-theorem — Solovay's Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-solovay-theorem]]","[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[89-df-consistent-pa]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-solovay-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-solovay-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-solovay-theorem — Solovay's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cc7f2e21119da30\" href=\"?note=1cc7f2e21119da30\" title=\"89-df-solovay-theorem\">89-df-solovay-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c9363f0c1d91236\" href=\"?note=8c9363f0c1d91236\" title=\"89-df-consistent-pa\">89-df-consistent-pa</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> is the property defined in\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1cc7f2e21119da30\" href=\"?note=1cc7f2e21119da30\" title=\"89-df-solovay-theorem\">89-df-solovay-theorem</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> is PA\nconsistency.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 展开后断言 GL 恰好等于 PA 的可证性逻辑</li>\n<li>模态逻辑与可证性逻辑的完美对应</li>\n<li>显式的一致性前提排除 PA 不一致时所有算术翻译都可证的退化情形。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-solovay-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"1cc7f2e21119da30","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-solovay-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-consistent-pa","status":"resolved","id":"8c9363f0c1d91236","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-consistent-pa]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-solovay-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"1cc7f2e21119da30","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA})$ is the property defined in\n[[89-df-solovay-theorem]], and $\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})$ is PA\nconsistency.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false}],"bytes":909,"backlinks":[{"id":"ea390338eae06fff","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-solovay-theorem]] — Solovay定理"},{"id":"8220f4203bbba1d2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e5cb4b74acf0f7a9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"Solovay定理的另一半 (see [[89-thm-solovay-theorem]])"},{"id":"789ec4567d4c52bd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a196c7fa2f0957d2","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一致性前提与 [[89-thm-solovay-theorem]] 一致；若 PA 不一致，右侧\n对每个 $A$ 都成立，等价式会退化。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-arithmetical-completeness-full.md]]\n[[89-thm-arithmetical-completeness.md]]\n[[89-thm-canonical-model-gl.md]]\n[[89-thm-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[89-thm-fmp-gl.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness-arithmetical.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness-kripke.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-decidability.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-decidable.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-soundness.md]]\n[[89-thm-godel-translation.md]]\n[[89-thm-henkin-provable.md]]\n[[89-thm-lob-theorem.md]]\n[[89-thm-normalization.md]]\n[[89-thm-solovay-theorem.md]]\n[[89-thm-solovay.md]]\n[[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl.md]]"}],"outgoing":["1cc7f2e21119da30","86ad48bbd1843ed6","8c9363f0c1d91236"]}